=== EDIT 2: /gin/response_writer.go ===
In the `WriteHeader` method, the `if w.Written() { ... }` block currently logs a warning and then falls through, overwriting the status. Add an early `return` at the end of that inner block so it becomes:

func (w *responseWriter) WriteHeader(code int) {
	if code > 0 && w.status != code {
		if w.Written() {
			debugPrint("[WARNING] Headers were already written. Wanted to override status code %d with %d", w.status, code)
			return
		}
		w.status = code
	}
}

